<title>UK: Eurofima sets 160 mln stg December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 160 mln stg December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    160 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    30.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.103    PAY DATE    15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    99.103    SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CH</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
